# Arthaura website — environment configuration
# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in real values, or set these as
# build-time variables in your hosting dashboard. Rebuild after changing.
#
# No secrets are required by this project. A Formspree form ID is a public
# identifier: spam control happens provider-side (Formshield, honeypot,
# optional reCAPTCHA). Never add an API key with mail-sending privileges to
# frontend code.

# ── Contact enquiry delivery (choose ONE) ────────────────────────────────
# Primary: Formspree. Deliveries go to adityashelar1206@gmail.com.
# Steps: create account → New Form → set notification email to
# adityashelar1206@gmail.com → confirm the verification email → copy the
# form ID from its endpoint (https://formspree.io/f/<THIS_PART>).
# Leave unset until then: the form shows an honest "not configured" notice
# and offers WhatsApp + mailto instead of faking a successful send.
VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=

# Alternative: your own relay (serverless function on your host).
# Must accept POST JSON (name, email, company, topic, message) and answer
# 2xx with {"ok": true} or {"success": true}. Used only when the Formspree
# ID above is absent.
VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=
